{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and run your fortress, become what you breed. Conquer the depths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominar Sanctum</strong> is a dark fantasy hybrid of <strong>dungeon management</strong>, <strong>real-time strategy</strong>, and <strong>third-person action</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the shadow of the Sanctum Mountains, a power awakens. Carve out your domain, command loyal minions, and shape the world to your will. Gather resources, defend your territory, and expand your influence \u2014 but beware: other powers stir in the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/extras/4bdfd001e6ae55b6283e1eb8ed1e338d.avif?t=1767300604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/extras_big/4bdfd001e6ae55b6283e1eb8ed1e338d.webp?t=1767300604 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/extras/e9b411fccd1d4e0bbc66481125ec42e2.avif?t=1767300604\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time for battle comes, <strong>take direct control</strong> of your champions or possess your minions to fight in real-time. Unleash magic, crush intruders, and lead your forces to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/extras/2d820104ffeb46bedfae5e613bf0df12.avif?t=1767300604\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Command. Conquer.</strong><br>Your dominion awaits.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087340?t=1767300604","background_raw":"https://sh